==== ClothingItemExtra ====
Used for clothes. The parameter indicates an additional option of how the item can be dressed additionally.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
ClothingItemExtra = Hat_BaseballCap_Reverse,
</syntaxhighlight>

